  "text": "def prime_fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"\n    prime_fib returns n-th number that is a Fibonacci number and it's also prime.\n    >>> prime_fib(1)\n    2\n    >>> prime_fib(2)\n    3\n    >>> prime_fib(3)\n    5\n    >>> prime_fib(4)\n    13\n    >>> prime_fib(5)\n    89\n    \"\"\"\n    def is_prime(num):\n        if num < 2:\n            return False\n        for i in range(2, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    def fib_gen():\n        a, b = 0, 1\n        while True:\n            yield a\n            a, b = b, a + b\n\n    count = 0\n    for fib_num in fib_gen():\n        if is_prime(fib_num):\n            count += 1\n            if count == n:\n                return fib_num",
